    <text x="400" y="348" font-family="&apos;Inter&apos;, sans-serif" font-size="12" font-weight="500" fill="#bbbbbb" letter-spacing="0.5">Decontamination Clay Bar • Glass Coating • Tyre Dressing Showroom Look</text>
    
